* outstanding operations. There is a sense in which this is already taken care of but 
* we could layer tracking individual requests on top (although under the hood they would 
* be completed in bulk).
*
* \todo Current code uses a FI_CHECK macro to test for errors on OFI calls; however, this just 
* prints an error and then either aborts or keeps going, so there is no way to handle an error. We need a better 
